#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#210 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Himelmez!! Already!"
+ "Varmundt: Himelmez!! Já!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#211 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: My name is Lisa Kahn Himelmez. Master of Dullahan, Dead man's Valkyrie, that's what they call me."
+ "Himelmez: O meu nome é Lisa Kahn Himelmez. Senhora dos Dullahan, Valquíria dos mortos, é assim que me chamam."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#212 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: Aren't you a little too feminine to be the Ruler of death? We are not afraid of you..."
+ "Heinrich: Você não é feminina demais para ser a Soberana da morte? Nós não temos medo de você..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#213 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Let's see if you can relax like that after you find out where your king is."
+ "Himelmez: Vamos ver se você continua tão tranquilo depois de descobrir onde está o seu rei."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#214 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: What?"
+ "Heinrich: O quê?"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#215 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Hmm, now I have your attention do I not?"
+ "Himelmez: Hmm, agora eu tenho a sua atenção, não tenho?"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#216 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: You don't want the king's position, just wait for him to come back. I like your purity."
+ "Himelmez: Você não quer o posto de rei, só espera que ele volte. Eu gosto da sua pureza."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#217 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: It's a pity to meet you in a situation like this."
+ "Himelmez: É uma pena conhecer você numa situação dessas."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#218 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: My king is visiting the Rune-Midgarts royal family. He's not back yet."
+ "Heinrich: O meu rei está visitando a família real de Rune-Midgard. Ele ainda não voltou."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#219 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: And now you are trying to trick me, what has happened to him?!"
+ "Heinrich: E agora você está tentando me enganar, o que aconteceu com ele?!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#220 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Well~ I would love to sit down and explain for you, but I'm kind of busy today~"
+ "Himelmez: Ora~ Eu adoraria sentar e explicar tudo, mas hoje eu estou meio ocupada~"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#221 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: I have business to take care of. My minions will treat you well enough for me~"
+ "Himelmez: Eu tenho assuntos a resolver. Os meus lacaios cuidam bem de vocês por mim~"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#222 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: She probably already knows where the Ymir's heart piece is."
+ "Heinrich: Ela provavelmente já sabe onde está o pedaço do coração de Ymir."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#223 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: All Khalitzburg and White Knights should follow me now..."
+ "Heinrich: Todos os Khalitzburg e os Cavaleiros Brancos me sigam agora..."
