- "Can someone..."
+ "Será que alguém..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#263 (unittalk)
- "Arrgg... My body"
+ "Arrgg... O meu corpo"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#265 (unittalk)
- "My throat is burning!"
+ "A minha garganta está queimando!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#266 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: My men... This can't be happening!"
+ "Heinrich: Meus homens... Isso não pode estar acontecendo!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#267 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Sir Heinrich, they're all monsters. You need to give them rest!"
+ "Varmundt: Sir Heinrich, eles são todos monstros. O senhor precisa dar descanso a eles!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#268 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: I'm so sorry..."
+ "Heinrich: Sinto muito..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#269 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: I am sorry, my knights! Forgive me!"
+ "Heinrich: Me perdoem, meus cavaleiros! Me perdoem!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#270 (mapannounce)
- "Sir Heinrich: Death to all!"
+ "Sir Heinrich: Morte a todos!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#271 (mapannounce)
- "Sir Heinrich: Go back to the darkness!"
+ "Sir Heinrich: Voltem para a escuridão!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#318 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: I killed my own men..."
+ "Heinrich: Eu matei os meus próprios homens..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#319 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: Sir Heinrich! We don't have much time!"
+ "Varmundt: Sir Heinrich! Não temos muito tempo!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#320 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: If you hurry now, there's a chance!"
+ "Varmundt: Se o senhor se apressar agora, ainda há uma chance!"
