- "Heinrich: Himelmez can turn living beings into monsters."
+ "Heinrich: A Himelmez consegue transformar seres vivos em monstros."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#324 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: But, there might still be survivors here."
+ "Heinrich: Mas ainda pode haver sobreviventes aqui."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#325 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: Destroy the monsters and find any survivors."
+ "Heinrich: Destruam os monstros e procurem sobreviventes."
