#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#799 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Really? What makes you think so?"
+ "Himelmez: Sério? O que faz você pensar assim?"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#800 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: Himelmez! You already made what you wanted so there is no more need for a sacrifice!"
+ "Heinrich: Himelmez! Você já conseguiu o que queria, então não há mais necessidade de sacrifício!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#801 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: Let him go! I don't need to see anyone else suffer!"
+ "Heinrich: Solte ele! Eu não preciso ver mais ninguém sofrer!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#802 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Let him go? I think... No..."
+ "Himelmez: Soltar ele? Eu acho... Que não..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#803 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Besides, this is your last surviving soldier, Heinrich."
+ "Himelmez: Além disso, este é o seu último soldado vivo, Heinrich."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#804 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: He made life difficult for me."
+ "Himelmez: Ele me deu trabalho."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#805 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: He is perfectly fit for my new creation Amdarais."
+ "Himelmez: Ele é perfeito para a minha nova criação, Amdarais."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#806 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: I'll never forgive you."
+ "Heinrich: Eu nunca vou perdoar você."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#807 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Uh uh~ I'm so scared."
+ "Himelmez: Ui ui~ Estou com tanto medo."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#808 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: Anyway, we will have a chance to see because we need to talk more."
+ "Himelmez: De todo jeito, a gente vai ter a chance de se ver, porque ainda temos muito o que conversar."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#809 (npctalk)
- "Himelmez: So long boys."
+ "Himelmez: Até mais, rapazes."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#810 (npctalk)
- "Gerhalt: You can make my body but you can't take my soul, Himelmez!"
+ "Gerhalt: Você pode fazer o meu corpo, mas não pode tomar a minha alma, Himelmez!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#811 (npctalk)
- "Heinrich: I'll never let you get away Himelmez!!"
+ "Heinrich: Eu nunca vou deixar você escapar, Himelmez!!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#812 (npctalk)
- "Varmundt: We have no choice. We have to fight against Amdarais!"
+ "Varmundt: Não temos escolha. Temos que lutar contra o Amdarais!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#813 (mapannounce)
- "Gerhalt's body is changing."
+ "O corpo do Gerhalt está mudando."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#814 (mapannounce)
- "Varmundt: Let me help this battle with my illusion. Just follow the illusion's orders."
+ "Varmundt: Deixem eu ajudar nesta batalha com a minha ilusão. É só seguir as ordens da ilusão."
