#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#833 (mes)
- "That is amazing ~ you made it all the way here. May I say thank you?"
+ "Que incrível ~ vocês chegaram até aqui. Posso dizer obrigada?"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#838 (unittalk)
- "Run away... run away from me..."
+ "Fujam... fujam de mim..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#839 (unittalk)
- "I don't want... I don't want to kill anyone. Uhuuuuuh"
+ "Eu não quero... Eu não quero matar ninguém. Uhuuuuuh"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#840 (unittalk)
- "Please kill me! Please!"
+ "Me matem, por favor! Por favor!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#841 (unittalk)
- "Eeeeee...eee...die... die..."
+ "Eeeeee...eee...morra... morra..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#842 (unittalk)
- "Demolition... Death!..."
+ "Demolição... Morte!..."
