+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#911 (mes)
- "Hm, you are very well. First of all, let me give you some loot from Amdarais."
+ "Hm, você está muito bem. Antes de mais nada, deixe eu lhe dar um espólio do Amdarais."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#912 (mes)
- "[Hugin]"
+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#913 (mes)
- "Varmundt's time is stopped by me."
+ "O tempo do Varmundt foi parado por mim."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#914 (mes)
- "And your time will be distorted soon."
+ "E o seu tempo vai ser distorcido em breve."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#916 (mes)
- "[Hugin]"
+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#917 (mes)
- "Maybe this poor time traveler will try to stop Glast Heim's tragedy from happening."
+ "Talvez este pobre viajante do tempo tente impedir que a tragédia de Glast Heim aconteça."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#918 (mes)
- "[Hugin]"
+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#919 (mes)
- "However, we will never overlook his behavior now and forever..."
+ "Mas nós nunca vamos tolerar o comportamento dele, agora e para sempre..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#920 (mes)
- "[Hugin]"
+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#921 (mes)
- "Now let me remove your memory. If you see me again it will be someone new."
+ "Agora deixe eu apagar a sua memória. Se você me vir de novo, vai ser alguém novo."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#922 (mes)
- "[Hugin]"
+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#923 (mes)
- "Oops. I almost distorted the time gap. Come over here. We need to go out!"
+ "Opa. Eu quase distorci a fenda no tempo. Venha para cá. Precisamos sair!"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#924 (select)
- "You were just with me..."
+ "Você estava comigo agorinha..."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#925 (mes)
- "[Hugin]"
+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#926 (mes)
- "What did you say just before?"
+ "O que você disse agora há pouco?"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#927 (mes)
- "Anyway, that is not important. The gap of time will be closed so we need to get out of here."
+ "De todo jeito, isso não é importante. A fenda do tempo vai se fechar, então precisamos sair daqui."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#928 (select)
- "Let me look around more:Please let me out"
+ "Deixa eu olhar mais um pouco:Por favor, me tire daqui"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#929 (mes)
- "[Hugin]"
+ "[Hugin]"
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#930 (mes)
- "Really? This place will be break down soon. Please look around quickly."
+ "Sério? Este lugar vai desabar logo. Por favor, olhe rápido."
#: npc/re/instances/OldGlastHeim.txt#932 (mes)
- "The crack looks suspicious but nothing more to check."
+ "A fenda parece suspeita, mas não há mais nada para conferir."
